    <Requirement id="ER-P028-03" level="1" requirementType="installation">
      <sysml:Name>传感器安装检查</sysml:Name>
      <sysml:Text>冷却水系统温度传感器、压力传感器、液位传感器等监测仪表应安装正确，接线牢固，信号接入监控系统并验证功能正常。</sysml:Text>
      <sysml:VerifiedBy method="commissioning_check" />
      <sysml:DerivedFrom refId="ER-P028" />
      <sysml:Traceability>
        <Evidence id="E-IACS-M51-001" supportStatus="supported_by_indirect_evidence" />
        <Evidence id="E-DNV-COOL-003" supportStatus="supported_by_indirect_evidence" />
        <Evidence id="E-COMM-COOL-001" supportStatus="supported_by_indirect_evidence" />
      </sysml:Traceability>
      <sysml:QualityStatus>
        <SupportStatus>supported_by_indirect_evidence</SupportStatus>
        <RiskIfUnmet>传感器安装不当或功能异常可能导致监控失效，无法及时发现冷却水系统故障。</RiskIfUnmet>
      </sysml:QualityStatus>
      <sysml:AcceptanceCriteria>
        <Criterion>检查传感器安装位置、接线和信号传输，确认符合设计图纸。</Criterion>
        <Criterion>调试期间验证传感器测量值准确，报警和跳闸功能正常。</Criterion>
      </sysml:AcceptanceCriteria>
      <sysml:EngineeringRationale>本条覆盖方面【传感器安装检查】，来自原始需求「传感器安装」。E-IACS-M51-001（IACS UR M51）间接支撑了报警和跳闸功能验证；E-DNV-COOL-003（DNV规则）要求监测仪表指示正确；E-COMM-COOL-001（综合规范实践）要求传感器功能验证。</sysml:EngineeringRationale>
