    <Requirement id="ER-P028-04" level="1" requirementType="verification">
      <sysml:Name>交船前整改</sysml:Name>
      <sysml:Text>冷却水系统安装和试验完成后，所有检查发现的问题应在交船前完成整改，并形成整改记录。</sysml:Text>
      <sysml:VerifiedBy method="review" />
      <sysml:DerivedFrom refId="ER-P028" />
      <sysml:Traceability>
        <Evidence id="E-DNV-COOL-003" supportStatus="verified_by_direct_evidence" />
        <Evidence id="E-COMM-COOL-001" supportStatus="verified_by_direct_evidence" />
      </sysml:Traceability>
      <sysml:QualityStatus>
        <SupportStatus>verified_by_direct_evidence</SupportStatus>
        <RiskIfUnmet>问题未整改可能导致系统带病运行，增加故障风险，影响交船验收。</RiskIfUnmet>
      </sysml:QualityStatus>
      <sysml:AcceptanceCriteria>
        <Criterion>检查整改记录，确认所有问题已关闭。</Criterion>
        <Criterion>整改后重新验证相关功能，满足验收标准。</Criterion>
      </sysml:AcceptanceCriteria>
      <sysml:EngineeringRationale>本条覆盖方面【交船前整改】，来自原始需求「发现问题应在交船前整改」。E-DNV-COOL-003（DNV规则）要求海试问题整改在交船前完成；E-COMM-COOL-001（综合规范实践）要求调试问题闭环。</sysml:EngineeringRationale>
